    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giidiing'diing'deayda Basaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeaksa Hesekiya heeda fuga sean bea Israeli ea Yuda aba ng'ata gang'oorsa barawajeega Efraimu ea Manase ghapka heeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Yerusalemu, ak gwasissa ghweelmeeda Basaaka NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba sugoocheanda sea fugaaschi hees ea fuga bwat geat aba Yerusalemu nilach girgweageeda gideaba gaygwasin ghweelmeeda Basaaka sheedeaba iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda ghwaraay gwasin aba damandaanyi aba gideaba ashoohoodiga mii ghoaghaydiit geat aba mooneeda deayeat, nea buuneeda ea miighabwat geat aba Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghwadaah sugoocheanda gideaba ng'asheesu ghwahit sea fuga sean bwat geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gang'weela gideaba gayghoadayda iita aba jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Israeli; gidang'eada Beer-sheba ea gagul Dani, gideaba gayghapka buuneeda sean ak gwasin ghweelmeeda Basaaka bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli, aba Yerusalemu; aba gideaba eemoojiga saang'a ning'ata mii gwasinda gising'waarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay fuga siicheakta jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Israeli ea Yuda nea gweata geadi barawajeega leabu heeda sugoocheanda ea fugaaschi hees, gawuurji gidarukuta sugoocheanda, nea gwayeesha, “Ea fuga Israeli, abiiksiina NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Abrahamu, ea Isaka, ea Israeli, ak gwadeepa gwayamseegwa geat agoogeeda oowooschi boosteanga ghayi oawaptaawi geatinga sugoodiga ng'eanyiida Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu goowuurjeewi ghweanigeagwa ea buweadeegeagwa; ghayi mandeawana masaweega aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, ak ghoadayda ghoah fuga nibur iheenga, gawuurji gidoong'uliidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu goowooschi fuga hang'oonyi iheeni gawuurji gida ghayi uurji ghweanigeagwa, agooga asisiina mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghoapkaanyi headaanyi ghaydit, ghayi niighaydiit damanda manda muudeanooda, ak googadiyeesi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak abeeda nyarastaanyi ng'waan gayghang'amwa heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gajabiiksiina NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda buweadeegeagwa ea diibigeagwa gayghwanyas baydeayda aba heeda fuga ghayi ang'waay saawa ghoah giing'oonyanga, ak abeeda gaygabiigu ng'eang'i. Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gabayiida fih nea ea inya jih, nea ea mayghoang'aamwa gheamamdaanyi heedeang'wa, inyas gajabiiksiina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweewa fuga siicheakta jeeda mujiineanagi ea gagul niirja aba jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Efraimu ea Manase, ea ghwahita Sebuluni; hean geebara reari nea geemachiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaghus fiisu ng'ay bea Asheri, ea Manase, ea Sebuluni gea was gea eada geat ng'eanyi ak ghapka Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geatinda ASEETA abeeda gwanda badayda Yuda ak ghoadaw guroorooda jea gwasin gidarukusa sugoocheanda ea fugaaschi hees aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda Basaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka fuga saang'a Yerusalemu gwasin ghweelmeeda mukaatajeega meematawiiteani aba sheedeaba iyeenya, hean ghabwat eemeeda saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eatng'eat gagadiiy ak gwanyarjeawi heeda wagiida ghayi mida Yerusalemu, ea heeda wagiida sean bea geediga ng'andidi sigwariida ak gageanda ak gaweay gwajaksa jeeda moangoachiyda Gidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanuus dayeenda gisilleanda Basaaka eaweeteaba damanang'wan bea sheeda iyeenya. Ak hean ghabwaspwas ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak ghoaghaydiit geat, ak gweadu haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaba siisi miinaada aba hoorgeadaanyi gawuurji gidanyaashta deaweeda Musa was siida ASEETA; ak gwasaksa ashoohoodiga foojeanda ang'waay aba geatinga fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwanda gea saang'a aba jeeda fuga bwat geat gea miighoaghaydiit geat, hean inyeesa fuga Lawi gaba siisi nuus dayeenda gisilleanda Basaaka gilinyoo ea miighaydit, ak ghaghaydiit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eemeetuw, gea saang'a bea Efraimu, ea Manase, ea Isakari, ea Sabuloni ea miighoaghaydiit geat, ak ghwaak Basaaka nea ea mii gidaweeda naweeda gil. Nea Hesekiya ea nimusiischi aba badahuuka nyaawa, nea gwayi, “NG'UTAMIIDA doabiiwaat dabwayda gilinyoo ea siida gil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siisi nyooh ghamiinda gurooroadaanyi gagaseada ASEETA, NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, eara ea maba giighaydidanda heeda ghaydit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooleeysiit NG'UTAMIIDA ghuuta Hesekiya, ak ghoahaap buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Israeli was gea mida Yerusalemu gwasin ghweelmeeda mukaatajeega meematawiita aba eawooji ispwa nea gahoosan muuchi; ak ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi gwaduumsheesa NG'UTAMIIDA galeaga sean, nea gwasarmasa NG'UTAMIIDA aba uurjeenga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goohoosan Hesekiya fuga Lawi aba gideaba ghoahiimu gearinda aba gadiyeesinda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ng'ata ghwaak buuneeda hamita ghweelmeeda aba eawooji ispwa, nea ghoadayda lukghumajeega haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo nea gabadiischeesa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeedeaba iyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwaheeleesa fuga bwat geat gideaba gajeesin ghweelmeeda aba eawooji ispwa gicha, hean gwasin gicha ghweelmeeda aba eawooji ispwa aba hooseaneega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ghoadaw fuga bwat geat heew sagalama ea gisil sagalamnyooji ispwa bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi ak fuga hees ghoadaw fuga bwat geat heew sagalama ea gisil sagalamnyooji damanamughuush. Ak ghoaghaydiit geat fuga Lawi aba mooneeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga bwat geat Yuda, ea ashoohoodiga, ea fuga Lawi, ea fuga bwat geat sean leabu jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli, ea bareanoodiga leabu ng'eanyiida Israeli, ea bareanoodiga abiita ng'eanyiida Yuda, gahoosan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanda hooseaneega hees Yerusalemu, aba gidang'eada damanda Sulemani was orjeeda Dawdi was sugoocheanda Israeli mii eesin ng'asheega uurji suh aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
